sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as OGXServerValidator<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant OGXCtrl as OGX Controller
    participant OGXServerCtrl as OGXServer Controller
    participant ConfigGen as configgen CLI
    participant Registry as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>monitoring.coreos.com

    Note over User,Prometheus: OGXServer CR Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply OGXServer CR<br/>ogx.io/v1beta1
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ogx-io-v1beta1-ogxserver<br/>TLS (webhook-cert Secret)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response<br/>(validates distribution, provider ID)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created

    Note over OGXServerCtrl,K8sAPI: OGXServer Reconciliation Loop

    K8sAPI->>OGXServerCtrl: Watch event: OGXServer CR
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get Secrets<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>OGXServerCtrl: Secret data
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get/List ConfigMaps<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>OGXServerCtrl: ConfigMap data
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PVC<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPA<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Ingress<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXServerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over OGXCtrl,K8sAPI: OGX Component Reconciliation Loop

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply OGX CR<br/>components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1
    K8sAPI->>OGXCtrl: Watch event: OGX CR
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update CRDs<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ValidatingWebhookConfig<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PrometheusRule<br/>ServiceAccount token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update OGX status<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over ConfigGen,Registry: Offline Config Generation

    ConfigGen->>Registry: Resolve OCI labels<br/>HTTPS/443
    Registry-->>ConfigGen: Image metadata
    ConfigGen->>ConfigGen: Generate declarative config<br/>from OGXServer spec

    Note over Prometheus,K8sAPI: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>kube-rbac-proxy
    K8sAPI-->>Prometheus: Auth validated
    Prometheus->>OGXCtrl: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>kube-rbac-proxy protected
